An unnamed workspace displays the generic “Workspace” label when a pane’s active tab is a surface or launcher, even though that pane contains an open chat whose title should name the workspace. `selectLayoutWorkspaceLeadTab` checks only the active tab (or the first tab), so search the pane for a chat tab, preferring the active tab when it is a chat.

```diff
-      const tab =
-        pane.tabs.find((candidate) => candidate.id === pane.activeTabId) ?? pane.tabs[0] ?? null;
-      if (tab?.content.kind === "chat") return tab;
+      const tab =
+        pane.tabs.find(
+          (candidate) => candidate.id === pane.activeTabId && candidate.content.kind === "chat",
